            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.14.21

- Removed the Refresh item from the menu bar. It scheduled the same check Now already runs every few seconds, so clicking it never had a visible effect.
- Now writes its album art diagnostics file in the background instead of on the main thread, so it can no longer hold the interface up while a cover is still loading.
]]></description>
